  <data key="d2">Page 8, Equation (7)</data>
  <data key="d7">K = 18.8516t^{1.0947} [Cl]^{0.4313} [w/D]^{-0.2447} where K = mass loss (g/m²); t = time of exposure (months); [Cl] = chloride deposition rate (mg/m²d); w = rainfall amount (mm); D = number of rainy days.</data>
