  <data key="d0">Expression</data>
  <data key="d1">2009_Ma_Corrosion_Science.pdf::expr_42</data>
  <data key="d2">C = A * t^B</data>
  <data key="d5">C = A * t^B</data>
  <data key="d6">Bilogarithmic equation for atmospheric corrosion behavior in the industrial site, where C is thickness loss and t is exposure time. The constant B is influenced by environmental pollutants.</data>
</node>
