<node id="Expression::10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::expr_63">
  <data key="d0">Expression</data>
  <data key="d1">10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::expr_63</data>
  <data key="d2">C = a + b SO_2 + c \cdot Cl + d \cdot TOW</data>
  <data key="d5">C = a + b SO_2 + c \cdot Cl + d \cdot TOW</data>
  <data key="d6">Simple linear dose-response function.</data>
</node>
<node id="Evidence::10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::ev_63">
  <data key="d0">Evidence</data>
  <data key="d1">10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::ev_63</data>
  <data key="d2">p. 12, Eq 13</data>
  <data key="d7">The basic form of the most commonly used dose-response function follows the simple linear... C = a + b SO2 + c • Cl + d • TOW</data>
  <data key="d8">p. 12, Eq 13</data>
</node>
<node id="Expression::10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::expr_64">
  <data key="d0">Expression</data>
  <data key="d1">10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::expr_64</data>
  <data key="d2">\ln C = a + b \cdot \ln SO_2 + c \cdot \ln Cl + d \cdot \ln TOW</data>
  <data key="d5">\ln C = a + b \cdot \ln SO_2 + c \cdot \ln Cl + d \cdot \ln TOW</data>
  <data key="d6">Simple log-linear dose-response function.</data>
</node>
<node id="Evidence::10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::ev_64">
  <data key="d0">Evidence</data>
  <data key="d1">10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::ev_64</data>
  <data key="d2">p. 12, Eq 14</data>
  <data key="d7">The basic form of the most commonly used dose-response function follows the... log-linear relation... ln C = a + b • ln SO2 + c • ln Cl + d • ln TOW</data>
  <data key="d8">p. 12, Eq 14</data>
</node>
<node id="Expression::10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::expr_65">
  <data key="d0">Expression</data>
  <data key="d1">10.1515/corrrev-2019-0100::expr_65</data>
