  <data key="d2">p. 13, Eq 16</data>
  <data key="d7">Klinesmith et al. (2007) constructed a model with a more rational structure including time-of-wetness (h), sulfur dioxide concentration (µg m⁻³), chloride deposition rate (mg m⁻² day⁻¹), and corrosion time (years)</data>
  <data key="d8">p. 13, Eq 16</data>
</node>
