  <data key="d2">CorrosionRate(rainfall, airborne_salts)</data>
  <data key="d6">Rainfall forms a thick electrolyte layer (enhancing corrosion) but also washes airborne salts away (reducing corrosion), leading to a complicated effect on atmospheric corrosion rate.</data>
</node>
<node id="Evidence::Corrosion Science 47 (2005) 2578–2588::ev_cpl_496188638">
