  <data key="d2">Page 10, Section 4.1</data>
  <data key="d7">The DRH and ERH values of NaCl at laboratory temperature are 75%-76% RH and 42%-46% RH, respectively, and vary only by 1% in an interval from 0°C to 90°C [9, 10, 14, 25-27, 31, 32].</data>
  <data key="d8">Page 10, Section 4.1</data>
</node>
